{"4488610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Outcast Bloom", "steam_appid": 4488610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an ever-growing defense network, meet and level loyal companions and discover a deep loot system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your legend by slaying hordes, invest skillpoints to suit your playstyle and experiment with different builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base or go on the offensive to destroy those of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488610/extras/2c9268fbf6021b8e3a2a05f793eab991.poster.avif?t=1787222904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488610/extras/2c9268fbf6021b8e3a2a05f793eab991.webm?t=1787222904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488610/extras/2c9268fbf6021b8e3a2a05f793eab991.mp4?t=1787222904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into many different scenarios to combat a huge number of tough monsters and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level your hero, unlock companions and new defenses and collect loot during scenarios to grow for the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488610/extras/0691a6acda03a10d00933d13704058ed.poster.avif?t=1787222904\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488610/extras/0691a6acda03a10d00933d13704058ed.webm?t=1787222904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4488610/extras/0691a6acda03a10d00933d13704058ed.mp4?t=1787222904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    5-25 minute scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    ARPG style meta progression with skilltree, equipment, defenses and passive bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Diverse bosses featuring unique mechanics and attack patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Unlock and explore many different maps and scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Craft potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Satisfying power progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\tCompanions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t..and much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full Content List</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >85 unique monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >125 skilltree nodes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t15+ map modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t100+ scenarios</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >potions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t3 artifacts</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an ever-growing defense network, meet and level loyal companions and discover a deep loot system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your legend by slaying hordes, invest skillpoints to suit your playstyle and experiment with different builds.</p><p